WEBVTT


00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:01.400
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:41.564 --> 00:00:43.899
Get outta my way!


00:00:43.933 --> 00:00:44.967
I called dibs!


00:00:46.902 --> 00:00:49.805
- Are those what I think they are?
- Wow!


00:00:49.839 --> 00:00:53.209
Oh, boy, I had to be late on cookie day!


00:00:53.243 --> 00:00:54.810
Cookie? Cookie? Cookie?


00:00:55.778 --> 00:00:57.713
- Here they come!
- Ah, it's crumb time!


00:00:57.747 --> 00:00:59.282
- I want a piece!
- Cookies! Cookies!


00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:01.951
They're at it already!


00:01:01.984 --> 00:01:03.918
- Out of my way! I want it!
- Hey, can I squeeze in, guys?


00:01:03.919 --> 00:01:06.489
- I've got beaks to feed!
- Snooze, you lose, Robert!


00:01:06.522 --> 00:01:08.224
- Oh...
- I want that cookie!


00:01:08.258 --> 00:01:09.659
- Hey!
- I called it!


00:01:09.692 --> 00:01:10.693
Snooze, you lose!


00:01:12.328 --> 00:01:14.730
- No touchbacks!
- Hey, no elbows!


00:01:14.764 --> 00:01:15.931
Oh!


00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:19.869
Aha!


00:01:19.902 --> 00:01:23.773
Come to papa! Ha! Score!


00:01:23.806 --> 00:01:26.542
- Wow!
- Yeah!


00:01:31.981 --> 00:01:35.251
Come on wings, don't fail me!
Don't want to miss it!


00:01:40.423 --> 00:01:41.624
My fellow storks.


00:01:41.657 --> 00:01:43.793
Now that we all have nested,


00:01:43.826 --> 00:01:46.729
we must concentrate on
the education of our offspring.


00:01:48.498 --> 00:01:49.799
Almost there!


00:01:49.832 --> 00:01:51.601
- The migration... Watch out!
- Whoa!


00:01:51.634 --> 00:01:54.537
- Incoming!
- Whoa! Oops! Oh!


00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:56.372
Sorry! Very late.


00:01:56.406 --> 00:01:59.342
Sparrows!


00:02:01.444 --> 00:02:03.913
Made it! Come on, cookie, let's do this.


00:02:03.946 --> 00:02:06.349
Did I miss it? Did I miss it?


00:02:06.382 --> 00:02:09.419
Don't worry, hon, you're just in time.


00:02:09.452 --> 00:02:10.820
Aw, and you brought a treat.


00:02:10.853 --> 00:02:12.922
To celebrate our new arrival!


00:02:17.493 --> 00:02:19.595
Richard, your Dad's here!


00:02:19.629 --> 00:02:23.466
Ha ha, he looks just like
I did at that age.


00:02:23.499 --> 00:02:26.068
Yeah, that's my boy.


00:02:26.101 --> 00:02:28.838
He definitely has your impatience.


00:02:28.871 --> 00:02:32.808
Looks like he's got
your pecking skills too!


00:02:32.842 --> 00:02:35.077
Come on. You can do it!


00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:37.313
Push, Richard. Push!


00:02:39.982 --> 00:02:42.017
Robert!


00:02:42.051 --> 00:02:44.487
Oh!


00:02:46.556 --> 00:02:48.591
You chose the wrong day, buddy!


00:03:22.592 --> 00:03:23.859
Oh?


00:03:34.737 --> 00:03:36.939
Ooh...


00:03:43.913 --> 00:03:45.448
Who have we here?


00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:49.685
Richard.


00:03:49.719 --> 00:03:52.722
Well, hello, Richard. I am Aurora.


00:03:57.560 --> 00:04:00.362
Shh... it's all right.


00:04:01.697 --> 00:04:03.065
Here.


00:04:05.435 --> 00:04:06.436
Mmm!


00:04:06.469 --> 00:04:10.105
That's good, isn't it?


00:04:10.139 --> 00:04:11.641
Where are your parents?


00:04:14.877 --> 00:04:16.579
Oh.


00:04:16.612 --> 00:04:18.013
Mommy!


00:04:18.047 --> 00:04:20.550
- Oh, I am not your...
- Mmm...


00:04:20.583 --> 00:04:24.420
Oh... come here.


00:04:24.454 --> 00:04:27.423
Mm... What am I gonna do with you?


00:04:37.467 --> 00:04:39.068
Hold on tight, Richard.


00:04:56.552 --> 00:04:57.820
Wow!


00:05:09.932 --> 00:05:12.167
No fish? What's in here? Frogs?


00:05:12.201 --> 00:05:13.636
No, Max, this is...


00:05:19.208 --> 00:05:21.611
Claudius, my dear.


00:05:21.644 --> 00:05:25.615
One of those pesky sparrows nearly
ruined my speech at the gathering!


00:05:25.648 --> 00:05:27.082
Mmm?


00:05:27.116 --> 00:05:29.985
Pests! What's for dinner?


00:05:30.019 --> 00:05:31.720
There is something I wanted
to talk to you about...


00:05:31.721 --> 00:05:32.955
Daddy!


00:05:32.988 --> 00:05:37.527
Aaah! Get off! Aurora!


00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:41.263
- Claudius, Max, this is...
- Get it off!


00:05:41.296 --> 00:05:43.499
- Richard!
- Off! Off, off, off!


00:05:43.533 --> 00:05:45.835
What is he doing here?


00:05:50.706 --> 00:05:52.842
He's fun! Can he stay for dinner?


00:05:52.875 --> 00:05:56.879
Certainly not.
Get this feathered leech off me!


00:05:56.912 --> 00:05:59.649
Go play with him, Max.


00:05:59.682 --> 00:06:01.884
Wanna go for a ride, Richard?


00:06:01.917 --> 00:06:03.686
- Max!
- Whoo!


00:06:12.595 --> 00:06:15.531
I found him alone in his nest.


00:06:15.565 --> 00:06:19.535
Sparrows. Stork parents
would never leave a chick!


00:06:19.569 --> 00:06:21.604
They didn't have a choice, Claudius.


00:06:21.637 --> 00:06:24.707
Their nest was... was ravaged.


00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:25.908
Oh...


00:06:25.941 --> 00:06:28.978
Still, this is none of our business.


00:06:29.011 --> 00:06:30.145
Take him back.


00:06:30.179 --> 00:06:32.848
I won't, my dear. I can't.


00:06:33.983 --> 00:06:37.653
Imagine if it was our son,
all alone in the woods.


00:06:37.687 --> 00:06:40.923
Hold on, kid. Turbulence ahead!


00:06:40.956 --> 00:06:42.725
Whoa!


00:06:42.758 --> 00:06:45.828
Where'd you go?


00:06:45.861 --> 00:06:48.664
All right. The sparrow can stay.


00:06:48.698 --> 00:06:50.833
I knew you would understand...


00:06:50.866 --> 00:06:53.235
Only... till the Fall.


00:06:53.268 --> 00:06:56.839
After that, he'll have to
look after himself. Agreed?


00:06:56.872 --> 00:06:58.240
And...


00:06:58.273 --> 00:07:00.610
I don't want the other storks
to know about this.


00:07:00.643 --> 00:07:02.712
And...


00:07:02.745 --> 00:07:04.714
he doesn't call me "Daddy".


00:07:04.747 --> 00:07:06.582
- Daddy!
- Mm?


00:07:06.616 --> 00:07:09.351
Look what I taught him!


00:07:09.384 --> 00:07:13.355
Hee, hee.


00:07:13.388 --> 00:07:16.125
Whoa!


00:07:29.639 --> 00:07:31.907
Whoa! Crazy, Max!


00:07:31.941 --> 00:07:35.277
- Can't handle it, little brother?
- Oh, I can handle it!


00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:38.080
- Ha ha.
- Faster, Max! Faster!


00:07:39.649 --> 00:07:42.752
Oh... oh... whoa!


00:07:42.785 --> 00:07:44.754
I meant that!


00:07:44.787 --> 00:07:46.121
- Sure you did!
- Whoa!


00:07:49.825 --> 00:07:51.593
Mm-hmm. But silent, okay?


00:07:59.201 --> 00:08:02.772
- I got it!
- Well done, my boy.


00:08:02.805 --> 00:08:04.840
That doesn't look so hard...


00:08:07.209 --> 00:08:08.711
Oh...


00:08:12.882 --> 00:08:13.882
Gotcha!


00:08:16.819 --> 00:08:18.688
Eeeh! Gross! Hmm.


00:08:22.457 --> 00:08:24.794
Whoa! Richard! Flying fish!


00:08:24.827 --> 00:08:26.829
- Yeah! Yeah! Yeah...
- Incoming!


00:08:26.862 --> 00:08:28.864
Ugh! I got it!


00:08:43.846 --> 00:08:47.216
Oh... oh...


00:08:47.249 --> 00:08:49.184
Nice!


00:08:49.218 --> 00:08:51.721
Hmm?


00:08:53.889 --> 00:08:55.691
Sorry, I fell out of bed.


00:09:05.034 --> 00:09:08.871
Come on, Max, I thought you were fast!


00:09:08.904 --> 00:09:10.706
Fast? I'll show you fast!


00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:13.475
Whatever you say, big brother!
I'm waiting!


00:09:13.508 --> 00:09:16.846
- I've almost got you!
- Ha ha, that's what you think!


00:09:16.879 --> 00:09:18.914
- Watch this!
- Richard!


00:09:18.948 --> 00:09:24.920
- Catch me if you can!
- The trees... they're so small!


00:09:24.954 --> 00:09:27.489
Hey! We're not allowed to go that high!


00:09:27.522 --> 00:09:30.259
Come on. Whoa!
You worry too much!


00:09:30.292 --> 00:09:33.763
No, it's too windy! Let's turn around.


00:09:33.796 --> 00:09:36.031
Chicken! A cool breeze
never hurt anyone.


00:09:36.065 --> 00:09:40.435
- Richard!
- Ah! Me and my big mouth!


00:09:40.469 --> 00:09:41.837
Gotcha!


00:09:44.774 --> 00:09:46.876
You didn't get me.


00:09:46.909 --> 00:09:48.811
- I came to you.
- Ha ha, oh, yeah?


00:09:48.844 --> 00:09:52.915
I was nose-diving, beanpole!
Good catch, though.


00:09:56.819 --> 00:10:00.089
- Dad's calling!
- Let's go!


00:10:08.497 --> 00:10:11.533
Why can't we take Richard with us?


00:10:11.566 --> 00:10:14.403
I mean, he's no burden,
and I could carry...


00:10:14.436 --> 00:10:16.906
Oh, be reasonable, Aurora.


00:10:16.939 --> 00:10:19.909
You knew this day would come.


00:10:23.412 --> 00:10:28.918
You are a wonderful mother, and
you have done all you can for him.


00:10:28.951 --> 00:10:32.121
But he won't survive
the journey to Africa.


00:10:32.154 --> 00:10:35.424
He has to live the life of a sparrow.


00:10:36.926 --> 00:10:39.294
Here we are. What's this all about?


00:10:39.328 --> 00:10:41.964
Finally! I've summoned the flock.


00:10:41.997 --> 00:10:44.967
- Come, Max.
- Hey, what about me?


00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.871
- I'm coming too, right?
- Hmm. Richard...


00:10:48.904 --> 00:10:51.473
Wait here until we return, all right?


00:10:51.506 --> 00:10:55.978
- What?! Why?!
- Do as you are told.


00:10:56.011 --> 00:10:58.347
- But we go everywhere together!
- Yeah, Mom!


00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:01.316
I'll explain everything
later. I promise.


00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:04.086
This is not fair!


00:11:04.119 --> 00:11:07.456
Max! Quit your lollygagging!


00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:21.436
Ahem. My fellow storks.


00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:26.608
Today, the old oak
has dropped its first leaf.


00:11:26.641 --> 00:11:29.845
The time of the great
migration has arrived.


00:11:29.879 --> 00:11:34.349
Citizens, we must migrate
before the winter comes.


00:11:34.383 --> 00:11:38.353
We will form a flock and fly south
to the Great Lake in Africa.


00:11:38.387 --> 00:11:41.523
Wow! Africa!


00:11:41.556 --> 00:11:44.026
Our journey is long and dangerous.


00:11:44.059 --> 00:11:46.128
- Oh, no no no no...
- And we...


00:11:46.161 --> 00:11:48.931
Mm?


00:11:52.201 --> 00:11:55.570
Hehe, hi there!


00:11:55.604 --> 00:11:58.974
- Richard!
- You know this bird?


00:11:59.008 --> 00:12:02.912
Know me? She's my mom!


00:12:04.579 --> 00:12:08.150
Claudius! Maybe we should
postpone our departure


00:12:08.183 --> 00:12:11.020
until your "family matters"
are resolved?


00:12:11.053 --> 00:12:13.956
My family matters are just fine.


00:12:13.989 --> 00:12:20.896
Richard, your mother... I mean,
Aurora should have told you long ago.


00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:22.597
Told me what?


00:12:22.631 --> 00:12:26.401
You are a sparrow, Richard.


00:12:26.435 --> 00:12:29.972
You cannot migrate.


00:12:30.005 --> 00:12:33.042
You belong here,
with the other sparrows.


00:12:39.982 --> 00:12:41.951
You almost had me there, Dad!


00:12:41.984 --> 00:12:44.519
You always did have such a...
Sense of humor.


00:12:44.553 --> 00:12:49.624
Haha. Hmm. Oh?


00:12:49.658 --> 00:12:52.261
Poor little thing.


00:12:56.999 --> 00:12:58.433
Come with me.


00:12:58.467 --> 00:13:00.535
I have something to show you.


00:13:00.569 --> 00:13:02.938
Hmm. Mom?


00:13:04.606 --> 00:13:06.075
Mom! What do you mean?


00:13:06.108 --> 00:13:08.077
- Wait!
- Richard!


00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:09.578
You stay here, Max.


00:13:09.611 --> 00:13:12.314
- But Dad? I...
- Stay!


00:13:12.347 --> 00:13:13.548
Our meeting is over.


00:13:13.582 --> 00:13:17.052
We shall depart at the break of dawn.


00:13:35.137 --> 00:13:37.272
Where are we?


00:13:37.306 --> 00:13:42.077
I found you here,
in this sparrow's nest.


00:13:42.111 --> 00:13:46.648
Your parents were... taken...
before you hatched.


00:13:46.681 --> 00:13:47.816
No!


00:13:47.849 --> 00:13:50.285
You're my Mom. And I'm coming with you.


00:13:50.319 --> 00:13:52.654
Richard, you can't go to Africa.


00:13:52.687 --> 00:13:55.324
I can, Mom!


00:13:55.357 --> 00:13:58.160
- It's Dad, isn't it?
- Richard, listen, we...


00:13:58.193 --> 00:14:01.196
Maybe my legs are short,
and my beak is tiny.


00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:03.532
But that's because I'm a small stork!


00:14:03.565 --> 00:14:06.101
But I'm gonna grow up to be a big stork!


00:14:06.135 --> 00:14:08.370
Big and strong! He'll see!


00:14:08.403 --> 00:14:10.539
- Wait!
- You'll all see!


00:14:14.043 --> 00:14:17.012
I can feel it, I can make it to Africa!


00:14:17.046 --> 00:14:17.913
Hmm.


00:14:17.947 --> 00:14:21.216
How hard can it be? It's not like
crossing an ocean or anything.


00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:23.218
Hurry up, you lame ducks!


00:14:23.252 --> 00:14:25.154
The Great Lake awaits!


00:14:25.187 --> 00:14:27.722
I'll show 'em how it's done!


00:14:27.756 --> 00:14:29.691
Speedy stork, coming through!


00:14:32.194 --> 00:14:33.161
Look at that little fella!


00:14:33.162 --> 00:14:35.797
With his speed, we'd be
in Africa in no time.


00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:38.233
My thoughts exactly!


00:14:38.267 --> 00:14:42.737
Ha ha! I'll just swing by to pick up
the family, then next stop, Africa!


00:14:42.771 --> 00:14:45.074
Argh!


00:14:45.107 --> 00:14:48.477
- Give him a chance, Dad!
- Do not provoke me, son.


00:14:48.510 --> 00:14:51.246
Storks could never survive the winter


00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:54.183
and sparrows could never
survive the migration.


00:14:54.216 --> 00:14:56.585
Never! That's just fact.


00:14:56.618 --> 00:14:58.753
But he can fly way better than I can!


00:14:58.787 --> 00:15:01.223
Did I not make myself clear?


00:15:01.256 --> 00:15:05.060
Sparrows are not made for
high altitudes. You know this!


00:15:05.094 --> 00:15:08.130
Richard would never
make it there alive, son.


00:15:08.163 --> 00:15:09.664
Is that what you want?


00:15:09.698 --> 00:15:13.735
I... I... Hm.


00:15:15.570 --> 00:15:19.208
- Hey, everybody! I'm home!
- Richard!


00:15:19.241 --> 00:15:22.111
- Are you all right?
- All right?


00:15:22.144 --> 00:15:25.247
Never been better!
I could fly around the world!


00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:27.849
Enough of this! Time to nest.


00:15:27.882 --> 00:15:29.551
We have a long first leg ahead of us.


00:15:29.584 --> 00:15:32.787
I can't wait!


00:15:32.821 --> 00:15:35.090
Whooo.


00:15:35.124 --> 00:15:36.625
I knew this would happen.


00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.299
Hey, why are you so gloomy?
We're going to Africa!


00:15:44.333 --> 00:15:46.535
Um, I guess I'm just tired.


00:15:46.568 --> 00:15:51.640
- We better crash.
- Good call.


00:15:51.673 --> 00:15:54.243
Gotta be prepped for takeoff!


00:15:54.276 --> 00:15:56.578
Am I right, big guy?


00:15:56.611 --> 00:15:58.147
Good night, beanpole.


00:16:00.149 --> 00:16:02.584
Sleep tight, little brother.


00:16:06.788 --> 00:16:08.857
Mm?


00:16:24.306 --> 00:16:28.410
Africa... Oooh.


00:16:28.443 --> 00:16:31.313
Hm.


00:16:31.346 --> 00:16:34.149
Be safe, Richard.


00:16:40.222 --> 00:16:42.191
We're running out of time.


00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:53.635
I can't believe we're doing this.


00:16:53.668 --> 00:16:55.470
It's for the best, Max.


00:17:15.224 --> 00:17:17.492
Huh? Good morning!


00:17:17.526 --> 00:17:20.262
Ready, willing and able to migrate!


00:17:20.295 --> 00:17:22.531
Let's get a move on...


00:17:26.235 --> 00:17:28.803
Mom? Dad?


00:17:31.406 --> 00:17:33.708
Max?


00:17:36.511 --> 00:17:39.248
Is that...? No!


00:17:39.281 --> 00:17:42.651
Wait! You forgot me!


00:17:42.684 --> 00:17:45.587
Wait! Wait for me!


00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:50.625
No!


00:17:55.464 --> 00:17:56.698
Come on!


00:18:19.588 --> 00:18:22.424
He looks dead.


00:18:22.457 --> 00:18:23.792
Poke him.


00:18:23.825 --> 00:18:26.861
What's that?


00:18:26.895 --> 00:18:29.364
Fine. I'll poke him.


00:18:29.398 --> 00:18:33.034
Hey, if you're not going to poke,
don't tell me how to poke.


00:18:33.067 --> 00:18:35.404
I do so know how to poke!


00:18:35.437 --> 00:18:37.539
See? Whoops.


00:18:37.572 --> 00:18:41.843
Ow.


00:18:42.944 --> 00:18:44.813
- Hmm...
- Huh?


00:18:44.846 --> 00:18:48.317
- Oooo hoo.
- Ah!


00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:52.354
Mmm?


00:18:52.387 --> 00:18:56.057
Who... who are you?


00:18:56.090 --> 00:19:00.295
I'm Olga, and this is
my best friend, Oleg.


00:19:02.464 --> 00:19:04.799
We're pygmy owls!


00:19:04.833 --> 00:19:08.437
Right... Oleg...


00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:12.006
- Um, am I in Africa?
- Mm? Mm!


00:19:20.682 --> 00:19:22.083
Want a bite?


00:19:22.116 --> 00:19:27.422
- Eww.
- More for us.


00:19:27.456 --> 00:19:30.492
Hey! Why would you think this is Africa?


00:19:30.525 --> 00:19:34.363
Oh. That's where I'm migrating
to with the other storks.


00:19:34.396 --> 00:19:37.432
At least I thought I was?


00:19:37.466 --> 00:19:39.701
Yeah, I heard him, Oleg.


00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:47.842
Eh... You do realize you are not
even close to being a stork, right?


00:19:47.876 --> 00:19:50.445
Ha! Shows what you know.


00:19:50.479 --> 00:19:52.647
My dad's leader of the flock.


00:19:54.816 --> 00:19:57.419
Sounds like Daddy issues to me.


00:19:58.887 --> 00:20:00.822
Oh, yeah, Oleg?


00:20:00.855 --> 00:20:03.358
So, why isn't he
with his flock then? Hm?


00:20:03.392 --> 00:20:07.429
Dad never believed in me.
Said I'd never make it.


00:20:07.462 --> 00:20:09.398
Oh! I see!


00:20:09.431 --> 00:20:13.468
Well, when you're not wanted,
you're better off on your own.


00:20:13.502 --> 00:20:15.904
- Right, Oleg?
- Wrong!


00:20:15.937 --> 00:20:19.408
I belong with my flock!
I'll catch up with them.


00:20:19.441 --> 00:20:22.811
And when I get there, my Dad
will see that I am a stork!


00:20:24.913 --> 00:20:26.415
You're very weird.


00:20:26.448 --> 00:20:29.083
I? I am weird?


00:20:29.117 --> 00:20:31.019
O-kay.


00:20:31.052 --> 00:20:34.589
Have fun with your...
"friend" or whatever.


00:20:34.623 --> 00:20:36.391
I'll go find my family.


00:20:37.426 --> 00:20:40.862
Hold your horses!


00:20:40.895 --> 00:20:43.498
South is that way!


00:20:43.532 --> 00:20:47.402
Pfft! Thanks, but we storks
know how to navigate.


00:20:47.436 --> 00:20:50.505
Fine! Go, stork boy!


00:20:50.539 --> 00:20:55.043
Ever seen a crazy bird like that?


00:20:55.076 --> 00:20:57.512
What do you mean, we're alike?


00:20:57.546 --> 00:21:01.583
"Not a stork"? I'll show her!


00:21:01.616 --> 00:21:02.951
Okay...


00:21:02.984 --> 00:21:06.154
They went south, and south is this way!


00:21:09.758 --> 00:21:10.759
No.


00:21:11.993 --> 00:21:13.795
No, south is that way.


00:21:16.598 --> 00:21:19.468
Uh... Or maybe this?


00:21:23.805 --> 00:21:26.007
Mom? Dad?!


00:21:27.742 --> 00:21:29.444
Hi, there.


00:21:29.478 --> 00:21:32.881
Oh!


00:21:32.914 --> 00:21:35.784
This is bad. This is really bad!


00:21:35.817 --> 00:21:38.052
Out of the way!


00:21:38.086 --> 00:21:39.454
Oh!


00:21:39.488 --> 00:21:41.956
- What are those things?
- Hungry!


00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:44.092
Follow us if you want to live!


00:21:50.865 --> 00:21:52.801
I'm right behind you.


00:21:52.834 --> 00:21:54.503
- I'm gonna catch you.
- Wait for us!


00:21:56.270 --> 00:21:59.240
Olga! Ah!


00:21:59.273 --> 00:22:01.643
Oh!


00:22:01.676 --> 00:22:02.977
Get down!


00:22:11.185 --> 00:22:13.555
I see you!


00:22:14.523 --> 00:22:16.024
Wait! I got...


00:22:16.057 --> 00:22:19.127
Oh, no, you don't!


00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:21.563
Surprise!


00:22:23.632 --> 00:22:25.567
Whoa!


00:22:26.968 --> 00:22:29.638
That won't shake them off for long.


00:22:29.671 --> 00:22:32.674
Get up, you two! He's getting away!


00:22:35.176 --> 00:22:36.545
- What now?!
- The light!


00:22:36.578 --> 00:22:38.647
We have to get closer to the light!


00:22:38.680 --> 00:22:39.948
- Got it!
- Wait!


00:22:41.249 --> 00:22:42.216
Yow!


00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:44.853
Not that close!


00:22:44.886 --> 00:22:46.888
They went over this way!


00:22:46.921 --> 00:22:48.122
Hey, bats!


00:22:48.156 --> 00:22:49.991
What are you doing?!


00:22:51.226 --> 00:22:53.161
- Hey! Let me go!
- You miss us?


00:22:53.194 --> 00:22:55.530
Looking for a tasty sparrow?


00:22:55.564 --> 00:22:56.965
- Yeah!
- Very yummy!


00:22:56.998 --> 00:22:58.800
Stork, you crazy owl!


00:23:00.034 --> 00:23:02.236
- Aah!
- Olga!


00:23:15.617 --> 00:23:19.588
Woo-hoo!


00:23:19.621 --> 00:23:22.991
Awesome!


00:23:23.024 --> 00:23:25.827
I mean... ahem.


00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:28.262
It's not like I needed any help.


00:23:28.296 --> 00:23:30.832
Mm-hmm. Right...


00:23:30.865 --> 00:23:33.902
See? This is what you get
for being nice.


00:23:33.935 --> 00:23:36.738
Big Bird here can take care of himself.


00:23:36.771 --> 00:23:39.207
Let's go chase some mice!


00:23:41.943 --> 00:23:44.946
Eh?


00:23:46.280 --> 00:23:50.051
Olga! Wait! Olga?


00:23:50.084 --> 00:23:52.754
Heh. You're still here?


00:23:52.787 --> 00:23:55.056
Oh, we thought you'd be
in Africa by now.


00:23:55.089 --> 00:23:57.191
Eh, I was thinking...


00:23:57.225 --> 00:24:01.963
Since we storks aren't nocturnal, and
you can see in the dark and all that...


00:24:01.996 --> 00:24:05.934
um, maybe you could, you know, guide me?


00:24:05.967 --> 00:24:07.368
Only until dawn, of course!


00:24:07.401 --> 00:24:11.272
Hmm. Do we look like
bird-sitters to you? No way!


00:24:13.842 --> 00:24:15.610
No, Oleg!


00:24:15.644 --> 00:24:18.880
And don't give me the evil eye!
Time to go home.


00:24:21.683 --> 00:24:24.653
Man, I hate your do-goodery!


00:24:24.686 --> 00:24:27.221
Ugh! We'll play nice.


00:24:27.255 --> 00:24:29.223
- Great, Olga!
- Thank Oleg.


00:24:29.257 --> 00:24:32.126
I'm doing this for him.
Come on, stork boy!


00:24:34.696 --> 00:24:36.665
I'm Richard, by the way.


00:24:55.884 --> 00:24:57.986
He hasn't spoken since we left.


00:24:58.019 --> 00:25:00.789
Max will grow from this.


00:25:00.822 --> 00:25:02.657
We did the right thing for Richard.


00:25:02.691 --> 00:25:05.694
I hope he's all right.


00:25:05.727 --> 00:25:07.696
Don't worry.


00:25:07.729 --> 00:25:10.699
I'm sure he's found
some sparrows by now.


00:25:27.916 --> 00:25:29.918
Huh?


00:25:31.252 --> 00:25:33.387
What?


00:25:35.757 --> 00:25:37.826
Where... where are we?


00:25:37.859 --> 00:25:40.729
What's going on?


00:25:40.762 --> 00:25:42.897
Oh, stop laughing!


00:25:42.931 --> 00:25:46.200
- Hey, Olga!
- I'm not fat!


00:25:46.234 --> 00:25:49.403
Hey, Olga! Wake up!


00:25:49.437 --> 00:25:52.707
Breathe!


00:25:52.741 --> 00:25:54.809
It's okay. Oh.


00:25:56.444 --> 00:25:58.713
- Eww!
- Nice one.


00:25:58.747 --> 00:26:01.315
- What's for breakfast?
- What was that?


00:26:01.349 --> 00:26:03.417
Never seen a pellet before?


00:26:03.451 --> 00:26:05.754
It's a little of this, little of that.


00:26:05.787 --> 00:26:06.988
You don't really wanna know.


00:26:08.422 --> 00:26:10.759
What are we doing on this thing?


00:26:10.792 --> 00:26:12.861
I belong in the air!


00:26:12.894 --> 00:26:14.362
Um, excuse me?


00:26:14.395 --> 00:26:16.497
Who had to fall asleep mid-flight?


00:26:16.530 --> 00:26:19.233
I... I... Hm.


00:26:19.267 --> 00:26:21.770
Exactly! Now chill.


00:26:21.803 --> 00:26:23.772
This thing took us further overnight


00:26:23.805 --> 00:26:25.373
than you could've ever flown.


00:26:25.406 --> 00:26:29.277
Oh, yeah? Then where's my family?


00:26:32.080 --> 00:26:33.782
If you really wanna know...


00:26:33.815 --> 00:26:36.250
What are you talking about?


00:26:36.284 --> 00:26:37.886
Just saying...


00:26:39.553 --> 00:26:41.856
They don't look anything like me.


00:26:41.890 --> 00:26:44.125
- Wow!
- Wow!


00:26:44.158 --> 00:26:48.029
- You're friends with an owl?
- Not friends!


00:26:48.062 --> 00:26:49.297
What?!


00:26:49.330 --> 00:26:53.267
Hi! I've never seen you before.


00:26:53.301 --> 00:26:55.770
A bunch of tourists just dumped
these tasty travel snacks.


00:26:55.804 --> 00:26:57.806
You guys hungry?


00:26:59.573 --> 00:27:02.877
I don't eat trash. I hunt and fish.


00:27:02.911 --> 00:27:05.313
- Oh...
- Suit yourself!


00:27:08.116 --> 00:27:10.785
- What brings you to France?
- Get this!


00:27:10.819 --> 00:27:13.387
He's going south, chasing his flock!


00:27:13.421 --> 00:27:16.290
But... we don't migrate.


00:27:16.324 --> 00:27:18.927
What kind of sparrow are you?


00:27:18.960 --> 00:27:21.930
I... I... I am a stork!


00:27:23.264 --> 00:27:26.267
- Wow. Huh?
- Hmm!


00:27:26.300 --> 00:27:27.802
Don't take it personal.


00:27:27.836 --> 00:27:30.404
He's a late bloomer.


00:27:30.438 --> 00:27:32.106
Oh...


00:27:35.109 --> 00:27:38.980
Poor things! Just wanted to say hi.


00:27:39.013 --> 00:27:42.851
No, thanks. Yeesh, so pushy!


00:27:42.884 --> 00:27:46.320
They're sparrows!
Pushy is their middle name.


00:27:46.354 --> 00:27:48.990
Can we get back to my family?


00:27:49.023 --> 00:27:51.525
Maybe we're close enough
to catch their scent by now.


00:27:51.559 --> 00:27:55.897
Talk about being pushy, right, Oleg?


00:27:55.930 --> 00:27:58.132
- Wait! You found them?
- Ooh!


00:27:58.166 --> 00:27:59.968
Go, Olga, go!


00:28:03.371 --> 00:28:05.206
Wait, this can't be right!


00:28:10.945 --> 00:28:13.214
Ah... what?


00:28:13.247 --> 00:28:16.350
Mein Hawk-Burger just flew away.


00:28:16.384 --> 00:28:19.888
What are you doing?


00:28:19.921 --> 00:28:22.056
Great, just great, Olga.


00:28:22.090 --> 00:28:23.892
My family could be
right around the corner


00:28:23.925 --> 00:28:26.895
and you're busy stuffing your beak!


00:28:26.928 --> 00:28:30.899
First things first, Oleg.
This stuff's magical!


00:28:37.338 --> 00:28:38.907
- Comment!
- Like!


00:28:38.940 --> 00:28:40.408
Huh?


00:28:40.441 --> 00:28:42.643
Fine, stay here.


00:28:42.676 --> 00:28:45.246
But, Oleg, all this delicious stuff!


00:28:47.515 --> 00:28:49.951
All right, all right!


00:28:52.420 --> 00:28:54.889
Hey, guys? Hey! Listen, you...


00:28:54.923 --> 00:28:56.891
- Aah!
- Have! You! Seen!


00:28:56.925 --> 00:28:58.092
A! Flock! Of! Storks!


00:28:58.126 --> 00:29:01.029
Aaah! Ouch!


00:29:01.062 --> 00:29:02.230
What was that?


00:29:02.263 --> 00:29:05.333
A sparrow just tried to hack me!


00:29:05.366 --> 00:29:07.235
Fail! What a troll.


00:29:07.268 --> 00:29:08.937
I'm a stork, got that?


00:29:08.970 --> 00:29:12.073
Not according to the Chick-a-pedia.


00:29:12.106 --> 00:29:14.442
- Ha ha ha. LOL!
- Like!


00:29:14.475 --> 00:29:18.212
- Hello? Someone there?!
- So, what's up?


00:29:18.246 --> 00:29:19.948
They must have fried their bird brains.


00:29:19.981 --> 00:29:21.449
Like!


00:29:21.482 --> 00:29:23.117
I'm wasting my time.


00:29:23.151 --> 00:29:25.920
Hmmm, I think I see how this works.


00:29:25.954 --> 00:29:28.356
- Love! Unfriend!
- Loading!


00:29:28.389 --> 00:29:31.059
Oh, what could possibly go wrong, Oleg?


00:29:31.092 --> 00:29:33.094
All you gotta do...


00:29:33.127 --> 00:29:34.228
Olga?!


00:29:34.262 --> 00:29:37.231
Suddenly I feel so...


00:29:37.265 --> 00:29:40.634
Connected!


00:29:40.668 --> 00:29:44.038
- Huh?
- OMG, an online owl.


00:29:44.072 --> 00:29:47.942
Olga! Can I friend you?


00:29:47.976 --> 00:29:49.309
- Me too! Me too!
- Me too! Me too!


00:29:49.310 --> 00:29:52.546
Uh... Sure! Wow!


00:29:52.580 --> 00:29:54.482
Six new friend requests already!


00:29:54.515 --> 00:29:57.952
- This is fun, Oleg!
- Ask them, Olga!


00:29:57.986 --> 00:29:59.420
Oh, oh, oh, right!


00:29:59.453 --> 00:30:02.423
Seen a flock of storks around?


00:30:02.456 --> 00:30:05.626
Storks? Non. Maybe someone else has.


00:30:05.659 --> 00:30:10.131
I'll check Facebeak.


00:30:10.164 --> 00:30:11.099
Aha!


00:30:11.132 --> 00:30:13.267
A friend of a friend
of a cousin's friend,


00:30:13.301 --> 00:30:15.736
- who I've actually blocked...
- Stalker!


00:30:15.769 --> 00:30:19.740
Says he spotted the storks
on their way to Gibraltar.


00:30:19.773 --> 00:30:22.276
Gibraltar! How do I get there?


00:30:22.310 --> 00:30:24.745
Shortest route or fewest wind farms?


00:30:24.778 --> 00:30:26.981
Never mind.


00:30:27.015 --> 00:30:29.317
I'll send Olga the coordinates...


00:30:30.351 --> 00:30:31.685
Ah!


00:30:31.719 --> 00:30:35.023
- Recalculating...
- Great! Let's go!


00:30:35.056 --> 00:30:36.590
Huh? Huh?


00:30:36.624 --> 00:30:40.261
- Olga?
- Ahh!


00:30:40.294 --> 00:30:41.762
He'll have to wait.


00:30:41.795 --> 00:30:44.665
I'm busy completing my profile!


00:30:44.698 --> 00:30:46.434
Come on, Olga!


00:30:46.467 --> 00:30:48.202
Lead the way!


00:30:51.372 --> 00:30:55.276
Just as I was getting to know her.


00:30:55.309 --> 00:30:57.278
I guess I'm back on the market.


00:30:57.311 --> 00:31:00.148
Like!


00:31:09.557 --> 00:31:13.627
Polly want a stale cracker?


00:31:13.661 --> 00:31:16.464
Because that's all you get
till you bring me customers!


00:31:16.497 --> 00:31:21.035
Sing, Kiki! Sing as if
your life depended on it!


00:31:21.069 --> 00:31:23.171
Which it does!


00:31:29.243 --> 00:31:33.181
♪ Oh, big ol' truck ♪


00:31:33.214 --> 00:31:35.483
♪ I love you best... ♪


00:31:35.516 --> 00:31:37.218
Little green waste of space!


00:31:46.560 --> 00:31:49.230
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:31:49.263 --> 00:31:51.532
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:31:51.565 --> 00:31:55.203
♪ Got to let it show, ooh! ♪


00:31:55.236 --> 00:31:57.105
♪ There's a new me coming out... ♪


00:32:00.241 --> 00:32:02.510
Oh...


00:32:02.543 --> 00:32:06.214
- ♪ Oh, big ol' truck ♪
- Cheap electronics.


00:32:06.247 --> 00:32:10.117
- ♪ I love you best... ♪
- If you don't shape up, I'm getting a cat!


00:32:12.186 --> 00:32:13.754
Mon Dieu!


00:32:13.787 --> 00:32:16.224
The Sanremo Festival begins tomorrow!


00:32:16.257 --> 00:32:19.293
<i>Attention! The express train
to Sanremo is arriving.</i>


00:32:19.327 --> 00:32:22.096
<i>It leaves immediately
after my coffee break.</i>


00:32:22.130 --> 00:32:23.764
Wait for me!


00:32:23.797 --> 00:32:26.134
I gotta get out of this prison!


00:32:26.167 --> 00:32:28.869
Help me, cracker, you're my only hope.


00:32:31.505 --> 00:32:35.409
Oh, no! I'm doomed!


00:32:35.443 --> 00:32:37.245
- OMG!
- Huh?


00:32:37.278 --> 00:32:40.314
Making friends is so much
easier than I thought!


00:32:40.348 --> 00:32:42.716
So, which way to Gibraltar?


00:32:42.750 --> 00:32:47.121
- Admit it! We're lost!
- It's not that.


00:32:47.155 --> 00:32:51.259
I have to show you.


00:32:51.292 --> 00:32:53.561
Thanks to Pigeon Maps,


00:32:53.594 --> 00:32:58.899
I got a bird's eye view on everything,
only from way up.


00:32:58.932 --> 00:33:03.204
We found you... here.
And... this...


00:33:03.237 --> 00:33:05.639
- is where you're headed.
- Africa!


00:33:05.673 --> 00:33:11.279
Totally. Thanks to Oleg and me,
we are this far already.


00:33:11.312 --> 00:33:13.147
But your storks, man?


00:33:13.181 --> 00:33:15.916
They're approaching Gibraltar over here!


00:33:15.949 --> 00:33:18.652
- That's a mighty long haul!
- So?


00:33:18.686 --> 00:33:21.789
Don't you see?
It would take us a week to get there.


00:33:21.822 --> 00:33:25.159
That's impossible!
You must've taken us the wrong way.


00:33:25.193 --> 00:33:28.662
Whoa! There's nothing
wrong with our senses.


00:33:28.696 --> 00:33:30.698
We're just not as fast as storks.


00:33:30.731 --> 00:33:33.301
And you know why?


00:33:33.334 --> 00:33:36.804
- Because we're not storks.
- That's the problem.


00:33:36.837 --> 00:33:39.373
You're not storks!
You're slowing me down.


00:33:39.407 --> 00:33:44.212
This kid is driving me bananas.


00:33:44.245 --> 00:33:47.248
There just has to be
a faster way to Gibraltar!


00:33:47.281 --> 00:33:51.952
That's my cue.


00:33:51.985 --> 00:33:54.888
Madame, monsieur?


00:33:54.922 --> 00:33:56.690
May I be of assistance?


00:33:56.724 --> 00:34:00.461
- Hmm?
- Aww! Look at you!


00:34:00.494 --> 00:34:05.366
The predator and its prey.
Need to get to Gibraltar?


00:34:05.399 --> 00:34:07.635
My name's Richard and this is Olga.


00:34:07.668 --> 00:34:13.207
- And? Ahem.
- Fine! Olga and Oleg.


00:34:13.241 --> 00:34:16.377
Quoi? Oh, I get it!


00:34:16.410 --> 00:34:19.347
- The owl's gone cuckoo.
- Cuckoo? Us?


00:34:19.380 --> 00:34:22.583
Richard's the one
who thinks he's a stork!


00:34:22.616 --> 00:34:25.986
Oh! Mmm...


00:34:26.019 --> 00:34:28.222
Of course he's a stork!


00:34:28.256 --> 00:34:31.992
The upright posture,
the inimitable elegance...


00:34:32.025 --> 00:34:34.362
- Muah!
- Finally!


00:34:34.395 --> 00:34:36.297
Someone who knows
what he's talking about.


00:34:38.031 --> 00:34:39.733
And just who are you?


00:34:39.767 --> 00:34:45.573
My apologies, Kiki La Spree,
disco parakeet fantastique!


00:34:45.606 --> 00:34:48.008
Ambassador to Sparkleville!


00:34:48.041 --> 00:34:49.843
Distinguished professor of...


00:34:49.877 --> 00:34:51.011
- Blabberbeak?
- Oh!


00:34:51.044 --> 00:34:53.947
I couldn't help but overhear
your little picking match.


00:34:53.981 --> 00:34:57.285
But don't despair.
I can get you to Gibraltar!


00:34:57.318 --> 00:35:01.955
I was headed there myself.
Isn't that an amazing coincidence?


00:35:01.989 --> 00:35:04.692
What does a cage bird want in Gibraltar?


00:35:04.725 --> 00:35:07.428
Why, I'm performing there!


00:35:07.461 --> 00:35:09.263
To welcome the migrating birds!


00:35:09.297 --> 00:35:12.400
At the... uh... Gibraltar Festival!


00:35:12.433 --> 00:35:14.968
Free me and we'll catch
a train out of here


00:35:15.002 --> 00:35:18.339
faster than you can say "Disco Duck"!


00:35:18.372 --> 00:35:20.040
But what's a... train?


00:35:21.842 --> 00:35:25.313
What the what? Ho ho!


00:35:25.346 --> 00:35:27.548
- Voilà.
- Whoa!


00:35:27.581 --> 00:35:30.451
<i>I'm halfway through my café Au lait,
so prepare to board.</i>


00:35:30.484 --> 00:35:32.820
- Oh, no! We have to hurry!
- What?


00:35:32.853 --> 00:35:36.624
He said the train to Gibraltar
is leaving tout de suite!


00:35:36.657 --> 00:35:38.326
You speak human?


00:35:38.359 --> 00:35:43.664
After a zillion hours of karaoke,
even you would, my frizzy feather ball.


00:35:43.697 --> 00:35:45.299
Makes us wonder


00:35:45.333 --> 00:35:47.435
what other tricks you've got
under your plumage.


00:35:47.468 --> 00:35:50.304
Come on, Olga!
Kiki needs our help!


00:35:50.338 --> 00:35:51.405
Merci.


00:35:51.439 --> 00:35:53.974
Now there's a lock underneath,
but be careful.


00:35:56.477 --> 00:35:59.347
- I said be careful!
- What's wrong?


00:35:59.380 --> 00:36:01.349
I am afraid of heights, all right?


00:36:01.382 --> 00:36:02.783
Help!


00:36:04.618 --> 00:36:07.455
- Oy!
- Am I dead?


00:36:07.488 --> 00:36:08.822
Not yet.


00:36:08.856 --> 00:36:11.459
I don't hear you singing!


00:36:11.492 --> 00:36:13.427
- What the...
- Olga! Get him out of here!


00:36:14.562 --> 00:36:17.931
I'm not getting my wings dirty!
You let him out!


00:36:17.965 --> 00:36:21.969
Out of my way! I've got you now!


00:36:24.572 --> 00:36:25.706
No!


00:36:27.375 --> 00:36:32.346
- Where are you taking me?
- Just keep quiet, can you?


00:36:32.380 --> 00:36:34.948
What kind of bird is afraid of flying?


00:36:34.982 --> 00:36:38.952
Flying is for the riff-raff.
I'm a songbird!


00:36:40.554 --> 00:36:43.491
Let go of me, you heartless harpy!


00:36:43.524 --> 00:36:45.025
Oh, okay.


00:36:45.058 --> 00:36:47.495
Just great!


00:36:47.528 --> 00:36:48.862
Hey, he asked me!


00:36:48.896 --> 00:36:51.532
Kiki! Just fly! You're a bird!


00:36:51.565 --> 00:36:54.502
- I can't! Aaaahh!
- Spread your wings!


00:36:54.535 --> 00:36:57.671
- Now taking my final sip...
- The train's leaving.


00:36:57.705 --> 00:37:00.541
- It's all over now.
- No!


00:37:00.574 --> 00:37:03.977
Just let me drop to my deaaaathhh...


00:37:04.011 --> 00:37:07.448
Make it stop!
Make it stop!


00:37:07.481 --> 00:37:09.483
Oh!


00:37:09.517 --> 00:37:11.652
Oh! Tulips!


00:37:15.556 --> 00:37:18.459
Great! Now I'm gonna get bird flu!


00:37:18.492 --> 00:37:20.928
- Huh?
- Help me!


00:37:20.961 --> 00:37:22.530
Birds!


00:37:27.601 --> 00:37:28.301
Oh, no!


00:37:28.335 --> 00:37:30.771
What?!


00:37:30.804 --> 00:37:33.106
That's our train over there!


00:37:33.140 --> 00:37:35.543
<i>All aboard for Sanremo!</i>


00:37:35.576 --> 00:37:38.779
Gibraltar, here we come!


00:38:05.539 --> 00:38:07.941
Dad! We can't keep going!


00:38:07.975 --> 00:38:10.444
- Everyone needs a break!
- No!


00:38:10.478 --> 00:38:11.979
We stick to the prescribed route!


00:38:12.012 --> 00:38:15.616
Can't we at least fly a little lower?


00:38:15.649 --> 00:38:18.586
No. Now keep the formation!


00:38:18.619 --> 00:38:21.989
Stay together, everyone!
Don't fall behind!


00:38:22.022 --> 00:38:24.658
- But Dad!
- Max! Do as I say!


00:38:43.677 --> 00:38:44.945
And when I woke up,


00:38:44.978 --> 00:38:47.548
my brother and my parents were...


00:38:47.581 --> 00:38:49.983
gone.


00:38:50.017 --> 00:38:53.120
I wish I had a dramatic
backstory like that.


00:38:53.153 --> 00:38:57.525
I always dreamed of escaping
my dreary surroundings


00:38:57.558 --> 00:39:00.628
to become a famous disco star!


00:39:00.661 --> 00:39:04.164
Loved... adored...


00:39:04.197 --> 00:39:06.567
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:39:06.600 --> 00:39:08.836
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:39:08.869 --> 00:39:10.938
♪ Got to let... Oh! ♪


00:39:10.971 --> 00:39:13.707
What is "disco," anyway?


00:39:13.741 --> 00:39:18.512
Some kind of courtship behavior
to attract a mate?


00:39:18.546 --> 00:39:19.713
Can be.


00:39:19.747 --> 00:39:23.116
Although I doubt you could
ever pull it off, darling.


00:39:23.150 --> 00:39:26.820
- Hmm!
- Hey!


00:39:26.854 --> 00:39:30.824
I'm used to it. I know
that I'm big and awkward.


00:39:32.693 --> 00:39:35.863
Well... didn't your mama
ever teach you to groom?


00:39:35.896 --> 00:39:38.566
Mmm...


00:39:38.599 --> 00:39:42.670
Let's just say my family
didn't exactly embrace me.


00:39:42.703 --> 00:39:45.639
Maybe with a smooth-out
and some feather-gel...


00:39:45.673 --> 00:39:47.541
Don't you see that I'm freakishly big?


00:39:47.575 --> 00:39:50.911
I've seen way bigger owls
on the Forest Channel.


00:39:50.944 --> 00:39:53.614
Yeah, but not pygmy owls.


00:39:53.647 --> 00:39:57.718
- Guess... uh... not...
- I just never fit in.


00:39:57.751 --> 00:40:00.754
- Sounds familiar.
- No!


00:40:05.358 --> 00:40:07.761
No, I literally didn't fit in.


00:40:07.795 --> 00:40:11.198
I mean, in the nest...


00:40:14.201 --> 00:40:18.005
Pygmy owls are supposed
to be tiny, not giant.


00:40:18.038 --> 00:40:19.472
A "giant pygmy"?


00:40:19.506 --> 00:40:22.109
- Is that like a "jumbo shrimp"?
- Shh!


00:40:27.981 --> 00:40:29.249
Ah!


00:40:37.057 --> 00:40:40.360
♪ Olga is a monster! Olga is a freak! ♪


00:40:50.070 --> 00:40:52.440
Oh... ohhh!


00:40:52.473 --> 00:40:56.009
My own family didn't give
a hoot about me.


00:41:04.251 --> 00:41:08.288
I didn't have a single friend
in the whole world.


00:41:10.724 --> 00:41:12.760
Mm? Mm?


00:41:12.793 --> 00:41:17.998
And then... I met Oleg.


00:41:19.199 --> 00:41:20.934
Ah!


00:41:29.810 --> 00:41:32.713
You've always been there for me.


00:41:32.746 --> 00:41:36.784
Awww... Ditto.


00:41:36.817 --> 00:41:39.186
Ahem. How can I put this?


00:41:39.219 --> 00:41:42.289
Some folks think, for someone to exist,


00:41:42.322 --> 00:41:44.124
you have to see them.


00:41:44.157 --> 00:41:47.194
It sounds kind of crazy, I know.


00:41:47.227 --> 00:41:48.762
Just leave us alone!


00:41:50.831 --> 00:41:52.700
- Nice.
- What?


00:41:56.336 --> 00:42:00.307
It's okay, Olga. I know how you feel.


00:42:02.342 --> 00:42:04.712
<i>Passengers, we will now dim the lights</i>


00:42:04.745 --> 00:42:06.947
<i>and wish you all a good night.</i>


00:42:06.980 --> 00:42:09.182
<i>We'll be in Sanremo in the morning.</i>


00:42:09.216 --> 00:42:10.784
Hmm?


00:42:10.818 --> 00:42:13.020
Uh, uh... He said...


00:42:13.053 --> 00:42:17.224
Uh, the breakfast buffet
has an omelet station


00:42:17.257 --> 00:42:19.226
and the toilet is backed up.


00:42:19.259 --> 00:42:22.830
Time for our beauty sleep!


00:42:22.863 --> 00:42:24.832
Good night!


00:42:28.435 --> 00:42:33.206
Here, hold on to me... if you want to.


00:42:40.447 --> 00:42:44.718
- Almost there.
- Uhh... Yeah.


00:42:44.752 --> 00:42:46.920
Good night, sweethearts.


00:43:13.781 --> 00:43:15.816
Don't feel guilty. Just go.


00:43:15.849 --> 00:43:20.220
Oh, I'm faker than a pair
of faux-leather stilettos.


00:43:20.253 --> 00:43:24.825
Oh, well, a diva has to do
what a diva has to do!


00:43:24.858 --> 00:43:25.858
Oh!


00:43:27.828 --> 00:43:30.931
What has she got in this thing, a piano?


00:43:30.964 --> 00:43:33.233
Oh...


00:43:33.266 --> 00:43:34.301
Kiki, we have to...


00:43:34.334 --> 00:43:35.769
- Kiki?
- Huh?!


00:43:35.803 --> 00:43:37.070
Birds!


00:43:37.104 --> 00:43:39.539
Shoo! Shoo, birds!


00:43:39.572 --> 00:43:41.942
Kiki?


00:43:41.975 --> 00:43:43.777
Kiki!


00:43:45.846 --> 00:43:47.414
Where are you?


00:43:47.447 --> 00:43:52.385
Forget him!
Let's just get outta... Here.


00:43:58.425 --> 00:44:00.928
- Well, if you saw the window, Oleg...
- Look out!


00:44:00.961 --> 00:44:02.562
Then why didn't you say something?


00:44:02.595 --> 00:44:04.998
- Oh!
- Wow. Owl coming through!


00:44:05.032 --> 00:44:06.934
Ooh!


00:44:06.967 --> 00:44:09.870
Oh! Oh, oh!


00:44:13.473 --> 00:44:16.877
Looks like you're not-a from here.


00:44:16.910 --> 00:44:20.080
Looks like-a you could use-a
some help from a local,


00:44:20.113 --> 00:44:24.184
like... Don Crowleone, sí?


00:44:24.217 --> 00:44:25.853
Well, I... eh...


00:44:25.886 --> 00:44:30.090
Hehe, I see you and it-a hit me
like a lasagna to the face!


00:44:30.123 --> 00:44:32.425
There's so many dangers
in this-a town...


00:44:32.459 --> 00:44:35.295
You gonna need-a someone
to a-look out for you, eh?


00:44:35.328 --> 00:44:36.897
Or you might run inta...


00:44:37.998 --> 00:44:40.500
Some very bad birds.


00:44:40.533 --> 00:44:42.369
- Hmm?
- So look.


00:44:42.402 --> 00:44:46.139
We protect you...
for a small-a fee, of course...


00:44:46.173 --> 00:44:49.977
so you can enjoy-a your stay in Sanremo.


00:44:50.010 --> 00:44:53.914
Huh? Sanremo? You mean Gibraltar.


00:44:53.947 --> 00:44:56.884
Scusi, Gibraltar?


00:44:58.418 --> 00:45:00.253
The bambino thinks he's in Gibraltar!
Ha ha!


00:45:02.089 --> 00:45:04.191
You're in beautiful Sanremo!


00:45:04.224 --> 00:45:06.026
- In Italia!
- W-what?


00:45:06.059 --> 00:45:09.462
Why you think-a we got-a
these-a wacky accents, ah?


00:45:09.496 --> 00:45:13.200
- Then where's Africa?
- Africa? Ha!


00:45:13.233 --> 00:45:17.004
- Way-a far away, over the sea.
- No!


00:45:17.037 --> 00:45:18.205
Don't try-a flyin' there,


00:45:18.238 --> 00:45:21.008
or you be swimmin' with the fishes.


00:45:22.142 --> 00:45:24.477
I knew that glittery green
schemer was up to no good!


00:45:24.511 --> 00:45:26.479
You mean-a the parakeet?


00:45:26.513 --> 00:45:28.481
I see him in-a big hurry.


00:45:28.515 --> 00:45:31.351
He asked-a how to get
to the Sanremo Festival.


00:45:31.384 --> 00:45:32.652
Weird little bird.


00:45:32.685 --> 00:45:35.055
Whaaaaat?! He used us!


00:45:35.088 --> 00:45:38.892
Sounds like you've been-a
had big-a-time, bambini.


00:45:38.926 --> 00:45:41.661
Hey!


00:45:41.694 --> 00:45:43.063
Richard!


00:45:43.096 --> 00:45:46.033
Shush!


00:45:48.135 --> 00:45:50.437
Wait... where are you going?


00:45:50.470 --> 00:45:53.040
How could Kiki do this?


00:45:53.073 --> 00:45:55.208
How am I going to reach my family now?


00:45:55.242 --> 00:45:57.945
No, Oleg! Hold your beak.


00:45:57.978 --> 00:45:59.947
It's time I straightened him out.


00:46:01.648 --> 00:46:04.684
You know what, Richard?
Maybe this will teach you.


00:46:04.717 --> 00:46:08.956
You're only in this mess 'cause you
won't accept what you really are.


00:46:08.989 --> 00:46:11.691
I really am totally sick
of arguing this!


00:46:11.724 --> 00:46:14.627
Fine! So then stop! Oleg, tell him!


00:46:14.661 --> 00:46:17.397
As if Oleg really existed!


00:46:17.430 --> 00:46:19.399
Leave him out of this, sparrow!


00:46:19.432 --> 00:46:22.435
Oleg's just in your head! Got it?!


00:46:22.469 --> 00:46:25.705
He's. Not. Real!


00:46:25.738 --> 00:46:27.540
La-la-la-la-la-la!
Aaah!


00:46:29.476 --> 00:46:32.279
Just great.


00:46:32.312 --> 00:46:34.081
My father had it right!


00:46:34.114 --> 00:46:37.017
Storks need to stay with their own kind.


00:46:37.050 --> 00:46:40.387
I never should've followed you. Gah!


00:46:40.420 --> 00:46:43.423
Fine! Go! Leave me!


00:46:43.456 --> 00:46:47.627
I don't need you! I don't need anyone!


00:46:47.660 --> 00:46:49.729
Oh, rats!


00:46:49.762 --> 00:46:53.400
No. I will not follow him!


00:46:53.433 --> 00:46:56.003
Ruffle your feathers
as much as you like.


00:46:56.036 --> 00:46:58.105
Whose side are you on?


00:46:58.138 --> 00:47:00.073
No, you listen, Mr. Do-gooder!


00:47:00.107 --> 00:47:02.742
Whose fault is it
that I'm in this mess, huh?


00:47:02.775 --> 00:47:06.246
You're nothing but trouble, Oleg.


00:47:06.279 --> 00:47:07.981
I wish we never met!


00:47:11.684 --> 00:47:15.022
Hm? Hm?


00:47:15.055 --> 00:47:17.457
Where did you go?


00:47:17.490 --> 00:47:19.426
Oleg?


00:47:23.063 --> 00:47:25.365
Oleg!


00:47:25.398 --> 00:47:29.036
Here! We love you!


00:47:29.069 --> 00:47:31.071
What's that fragrance?


00:47:31.104 --> 00:47:34.641
Why, it's the sweet smell
of superstardom!


00:47:34.674 --> 00:47:37.344
First prize, here I come! Huh?


00:47:37.377 --> 00:47:39.612
Who put this man-shaped mountain here?


00:47:39.646 --> 00:47:40.947
<i>Attenzione!</i>


00:47:40.980 --> 00:47:44.517
<i>All songbirds to the roof
for the Sanremo festival!</i>


00:47:44.551 --> 00:47:46.053
Oh!


00:47:46.086 --> 00:47:49.356
Why do bird events always
have to be high up?


00:47:49.389 --> 00:47:52.025
One... wing in front of the... other.


00:47:53.260 --> 00:47:56.029
Registrazione!


00:47:56.063 --> 00:47:59.532
Registrazione for the
birdsong festival here-a!


00:47:59.566 --> 00:48:02.435
It is showtime!


00:48:04.437 --> 00:48:07.807
Somebody's got to know
the way to Africa around here.


00:48:07.840 --> 00:48:10.377
Storks!


00:48:12.845 --> 00:48:14.081
Hello?


00:48:17.417 --> 00:48:19.319
Hello?


00:48:22.222 --> 00:48:25.358
Anybody home?


00:48:28.761 --> 00:48:30.563
Anybody?


00:48:39.572 --> 00:48:42.775
They must be in Africa by now.


00:48:42.809 --> 00:48:44.277
Aw...


00:48:48.781 --> 00:48:50.117
Oleg!


00:48:52.285 --> 00:48:54.121
Where are you?


00:48:54.154 --> 00:48:56.156
I didn't mean it!


00:48:57.257 --> 00:48:59.159
Come back!


00:49:01.428 --> 00:49:02.862
Post!


00:49:02.895 --> 00:49:06.099
- Share!
- Posting!


00:49:06.133 --> 00:49:08.868
You guys gotta help me!


00:49:08.901 --> 00:49:09.969
I'm looking for Oleg!


00:49:10.002 --> 00:49:14.374
I lost him. I lost Richard.
I lost all my friends.


00:49:14.407 --> 00:49:19.046
Wait! Aren't you that weirdo
owl we heard about online?


00:49:19.079 --> 00:49:20.948
The one who was chasing a sparrow


00:49:20.981 --> 00:49:23.984
- who thought he was a stork?
- Yes! That's me!


00:49:24.017 --> 00:49:26.053
Uh... except for the "weirdo part".


00:49:26.086 --> 00:49:26.954
That's-a you?


00:49:26.987 --> 00:49:30.290
You're-a trending like-a mad! Plug in.


00:49:30.323 --> 00:49:33.093
Yeah. We got-a the hi-speed cable.


00:49:33.126 --> 00:49:34.928
Um, okay.


00:49:34.962 --> 00:49:36.263
But... only for a second.


00:49:36.296 --> 00:49:38.298
Hopefully somebody's seen my friends.


00:49:40.300 --> 00:49:44.404
High speed! Life in the fast lane!


00:49:44.437 --> 00:49:45.939
Told ya!


00:49:45.973 --> 00:49:48.208
Okay, now let's find Oleg.


00:49:49.309 --> 00:49:53.580
OMG! I got 3012 friend requests?!


00:49:54.847 --> 00:49:57.300
Would you mind confirming
my friend request first?


00:49:57.302 --> 00:49:58.119
Mmm?


00:49:58.151 --> 00:49:58.885
Yeah! Mine too!


00:49:58.918 --> 00:50:03.991
Sure! I'll confirm all of them!


00:50:04.024 --> 00:50:05.225
- So many...
- Like!


00:50:05.258 --> 00:50:07.094
- New friends!
- Post!


00:50:10.030 --> 00:50:12.665
Mmm. This is it!


00:50:12.699 --> 00:50:15.035
Your magic moment!


00:50:15.068 --> 00:50:19.139
<i>Welcome to the Sanremo Festival!</i>


00:50:19.172 --> 00:50:21.674
If only I had some friends
to cheer for me.


00:50:21.708 --> 00:50:26.346
<i>And-a now we open the show
with an all-time disco classic.</i>


00:50:26.379 --> 00:50:29.749
Oh, well, the show must go on.


00:50:29.782 --> 00:50:31.985
<i>It's the parakeet
with the tweet so sweet...</i>


00:50:32.019 --> 00:50:34.487
<i>The stunningly gorgeous...</i>


00:50:34.521 --> 00:50:37.024
<i>The breathtakingly beautiful...</i>


00:50:37.057 --> 00:50:39.259
- Koko!
- Oh! What?!


00:50:39.292 --> 00:50:41.461
No, no, no! My name is...


00:50:41.494 --> 00:50:44.597
- Performers only!
- That's what I am!


00:50:44.631 --> 00:50:46.133
Oh, oh, please, please...


00:50:46.166 --> 00:50:48.535
- Oh... no!
- Oh, my!


00:50:48.568 --> 00:50:52.139
Mille grazie!
Mille grazie!


00:50:52.172 --> 00:50:54.441
- ♪ I'm... ♪
- Argh! It can't be!


00:50:54.474 --> 00:50:56.043
- I have to get up there...
- ♪ Coming ♪


00:50:56.076 --> 00:50:57.510
- Ah-ah-ah!
- ♪ Out ♪


00:50:57.544 --> 00:50:59.479
But that's my song!


00:50:59.512 --> 00:51:01.448
♪ I'm coming ♪


00:51:01.481 --> 00:51:03.716
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:51:03.750 --> 00:51:06.053
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:51:06.086 --> 00:51:08.555
♪ I got to let it show ♪


00:51:10.190 --> 00:51:12.192
♪ There's a new me coming out ♪


00:51:12.225 --> 00:51:14.127
♪ And I just had to live ♪


00:51:14.161 --> 00:51:15.695
♪ And I want to give... ♪


00:51:29.776 --> 00:51:35.082
I can do this! Hmm!


00:51:38.085 --> 00:51:40.520
♪ ...got to let it show ♪


00:51:40.553 --> 00:51:43.423
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:51:43.456 --> 00:51:45.825
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:51:45.858 --> 00:51:48.428
♪ I got to let it show ♪


00:51:52.265 --> 00:51:54.101
- Go on!
- Yeah!


00:51:54.134 --> 00:51:57.070
♪ I'm coming out ♪


00:51:57.104 --> 00:51:59.072
♪ I want the world to know ♪


00:51:59.106 --> 00:52:00.440
♪ Got to let it show... ♪


00:52:01.741 --> 00:52:03.276
<i>Attenzione, passengers!</i>


00:52:03.310 --> 00:52:08.548
<i>Ferry departs to Tunis, Africa, Pier 12.</i>


00:52:12.119 --> 00:52:15.688
Oh, ferry to Africa... pfft!


00:52:15.722 --> 00:52:19.359
This dreamboat's got
nothing left to twirl for.


00:52:19.392 --> 00:52:25.598
Au revoir, fame!
Bonjour, oblivion!


00:52:25.632 --> 00:52:28.268
Luigi! Everybody's at-a the cliffs!


00:52:28.301 --> 00:52:32.272
A sparrow wants to fly
across-a da sea to Africa!


00:52:32.305 --> 00:52:35.542
But-a that's-a crazy dangerous!


00:52:35.575 --> 00:52:38.111
Great! Let's-a go!


00:52:39.279 --> 00:52:42.149
Richard?


00:52:42.182 --> 00:52:45.285
Oh! I've got to stop him!


00:52:48.521 --> 00:52:52.425
Oh, I can't, I just can't!


00:52:52.459 --> 00:52:56.129
But Richard needs me! Ah! Eh!


00:52:56.163 --> 00:53:01.100
Here comes Kiki! Whoa! Whoa!


00:53:03.203 --> 00:53:07.274
Oh, no, no, no!
It'll be all right, Richard!


00:53:14.314 --> 00:53:17.150
Good job, little piggy!


00:53:18.318 --> 00:53:21.154
Olga?! Oh! Oh!


00:53:21.188 --> 00:53:25.292
For the love of Donna Summer,
what are you doing?


00:53:27.260 --> 00:53:29.696
I'm tilling my virtual farm.


00:53:29.729 --> 00:53:32.199
Leave her alone,
or I'll block-a your access!


00:53:32.232 --> 00:53:35.302
# PeskyParakeet!


00:53:35.335 --> 00:53:36.836
Oh... oh!


00:53:36.869 --> 00:53:39.172
Re-post!


00:53:43.410 --> 00:53:44.544
What have you done?


00:53:44.577 --> 00:53:46.679
Let's find another hotspot, quick!


00:53:46.713 --> 00:53:49.282
Dislike!


00:53:49.316 --> 00:53:50.850
- Richard needs our help!
- You!


00:53:50.883 --> 00:53:53.353
Why should I trust you?


00:53:53.386 --> 00:53:55.388
You tricked me once already,


00:53:55.422 --> 00:54:00.860
you deceitful, manipulative
superficial parakeet!


00:54:00.893 --> 00:54:03.463
Richard thinks he can fly
across the sea all by himself!


00:54:03.496 --> 00:54:05.898
But he'll never make it!


00:54:05.932 --> 00:54:08.268
We go to stop him!


00:54:08.301 --> 00:54:11.704
He left me, just like Oleg did.
Why should I care?


00:54:11.738 --> 00:54:14.241
Because you're friends!


00:54:14.274 --> 00:54:16.343
- Oh...
- Aw.


00:54:16.376 --> 00:54:19.212
Richard needs you. It's true.


00:54:19.246 --> 00:54:21.348
Ooh... ooh... ahh!


00:54:21.381 --> 00:54:24.351
I'll break your groove-thing


00:54:24.384 --> 00:54:26.219
if this is another one of your tricks!


00:54:26.253 --> 00:54:29.522
Eat me alive if you want! Just hurry!


00:54:29.556 --> 00:54:32.659
- Come on!
- I got you.


00:54:32.692 --> 00:54:34.227
Man, you're heavy for a parakeet.


00:54:34.261 --> 00:54:35.662
Said the giantess?


00:54:48.341 --> 00:54:49.642
Whoa!


00:54:49.676 --> 00:54:53.246
Hurry! That wacky sparrow's
a-gonna jump offa da cliff!


00:54:53.280 --> 00:54:56.783
With those-a winds?
He's-a cuckoo!


00:54:56.816 --> 00:54:59.018
I bet-a you three
herrings he goes-a splat.


00:54:59.051 --> 00:55:00.186
- Huh?
- You're on!


00:55:00.219 --> 00:55:03.690
- You can do it!
- Come on! Do it!


00:55:08.295 --> 00:55:09.762
- Jump!
- Come on!


00:55:09.796 --> 00:55:13.400
- Richard!
- Don't jump!


00:55:13.433 --> 00:55:16.403
We had a bet!


00:55:16.436 --> 00:55:17.937
Can't you see I'm busy here?


00:55:17.970 --> 00:55:19.872
No, Richard! It will kill you!


00:55:19.906 --> 00:55:22.642
- Yeah!
- Forgive me, please!


00:55:22.675 --> 00:55:25.412
I know I've been despicable.


00:55:25.445 --> 00:55:28.481
I beg you. Let me make it up to you!


00:55:28.515 --> 00:55:30.483
- Jump!
- Do it, do it, do it!


00:55:30.517 --> 00:55:34.053
I've lost Oleg already.
I can't lose you too!


00:55:34.086 --> 00:55:37.957
There's a safe way across to Africa.
A ferry!


00:55:37.990 --> 00:55:39.926
It's like a train that floats on water.


00:55:39.959 --> 00:55:42.395
No. I am a stork!


00:55:42.429 --> 00:55:44.297
Time I started acting like one.


00:55:49.469 --> 00:55:51.070
Richard!


00:55:56.343 --> 00:55:57.677
Just great.


00:55:57.710 --> 00:55:59.979
See you big boys over the rainbow!


00:56:01.147 --> 00:56:05.352
I bet-a you six herring
the green one chokes first.


00:56:08.655 --> 00:56:11.358
- Spread your wings!
- I can't! I can't!


00:56:13.526 --> 00:56:15.995
Heeeeere I cooooome!


00:56:27.740 --> 00:56:30.477
- There they go!
- Ho ho, yeah!


00:56:30.510 --> 00:56:35.482
- Pay up!
- Fine.


00:56:40.520 --> 00:56:42.455
Are we going down or up?


00:56:42.489 --> 00:56:45.425
We'll know if we crash and drown!


00:56:50.897 --> 00:56:53.533
Oh?


00:56:53.566 --> 00:56:55.034
Wow!


00:56:55.067 --> 00:56:57.404
This is amazing!


00:56:57.437 --> 00:57:00.540
Dazzle-tastic!


00:57:00.573 --> 00:57:04.010
This is definitely going in my memoirs.


00:57:04.043 --> 00:57:06.813
Too beautiful to stand!


00:57:06.846 --> 00:57:09.682
Right, Oleg? Oh.


00:57:09.716 --> 00:57:10.750
Mmm...


00:57:10.783 --> 00:57:14.387
Oh, wow...


00:57:14.421 --> 00:57:17.424
Oh...


00:57:17.457 --> 00:57:21.394
Africa, here we cooome!


00:57:35.608 --> 00:57:40.146
Look, a shooting star!
Everybody make a wish.


00:57:47.119 --> 00:57:51.558
That is no shooting star!


00:57:51.591 --> 00:57:53.893
And definitely not what I wished for!


00:57:58.765 --> 00:58:02.435
Darnit, not again.
There's something on the scope.


00:58:13.480 --> 00:58:16.483
Running on a plane
was not on my bucket list!


00:58:16.516 --> 00:58:19.218
Stay together!


00:58:21.621 --> 00:58:23.590
Olgaaaa!


00:58:31.130 --> 00:58:33.600
Where is Olga?


00:58:33.633 --> 00:58:35.134
Over there!


00:58:35.167 --> 00:58:39.839
- Olga!
- We'll save you, darling!


00:58:46.679 --> 00:58:48.247
Whoa!


00:58:48.280 --> 00:58:49.949
We have to find somewhere to land.


00:58:51.584 --> 00:58:54.120
In the middle of the sea?!


00:58:54.153 --> 00:58:55.688
There! What's that?


00:58:55.722 --> 00:58:57.824
An ocean liner!


00:59:03.530 --> 00:59:04.530
Whoo!


00:59:16.843 --> 00:59:20.680
I always wanted to learn
synchronized swimming.


00:59:20.713 --> 00:59:23.516
Olga!


00:59:23.550 --> 00:59:25.685
Darling!


00:59:25.718 --> 00:59:26.853
No!


00:59:34.627 --> 00:59:36.696
Oh!


00:59:36.729 --> 00:59:39.298
Olga! Come on! Get up!


00:59:39.331 --> 00:59:42.869
I know what to do!


00:59:44.571 --> 00:59:47.306
First aid poster.


00:59:47.339 --> 00:59:49.709
I stared at the thing for years.


00:59:49.742 --> 00:59:53.680
Come on. Olga, come on!


00:59:53.713 --> 00:59:56.949
Oh... oh...


01:00:00.720 --> 01:00:05.725
It's... too late.


01:00:05.758 --> 01:00:07.594
No.


01:00:14.901 --> 01:00:17.003
Oleg?


01:00:17.036 --> 01:00:19.739
Please...


01:00:19.772 --> 01:00:21.073
Can you help her?


01:00:24.043 --> 01:00:27.079
It's all my fault, and I'm sorry.


01:00:28.881 --> 01:00:31.183
Please bring her back!


01:00:31.217 --> 01:00:33.653
She needs you more than ever, Oleg.


01:00:49.636 --> 01:00:52.038
Ah...


01:00:52.071 --> 01:00:53.740
- Oh...
- Huh?


01:00:53.773 --> 01:00:56.676
- Oleg? Is that you?
- Ha ha!


01:00:56.709 --> 01:00:59.612
- Yes!
- All right, yes! You're back!


01:01:01.814 --> 01:01:05.752
Whoa!


01:01:05.785 --> 01:01:09.088
Eww! Oh...


01:01:09.121 --> 01:01:13.059
This is the best gift I've ever gotten!


01:01:13.092 --> 01:01:16.128
Oh...


01:01:16.162 --> 01:01:18.698
Missed you, too, Oleg.


01:01:26.873 --> 01:01:32.411
This... is the life.


01:01:32.444 --> 01:01:35.682
"Indulge yourself in our luxury spa,


01:01:35.715 --> 01:01:38.818
with 'all-you-can-heat'
sauna privileges,


01:01:38.851 --> 01:01:41.320
as we near our destination of..."


01:01:41.353 --> 01:01:42.488
Hey!


01:01:42.521 --> 01:01:46.859
You'll never guess where
we're headed, tweethearts!


01:01:46.893 --> 01:01:48.360
Africa!


01:01:48.394 --> 01:01:50.797
You can join the other storks after all!


01:01:50.830 --> 01:01:52.799
Ahem. Mm.


01:01:52.832 --> 01:01:55.401
Huh? Oh...


01:01:57.236 --> 01:02:01.107
"Other storks"?


01:02:01.140 --> 01:02:03.676
Claudius was right.


01:02:03.710 --> 01:02:07.146
You all were. I'm not a stork.


01:02:07.179 --> 01:02:09.749
I'll never be one.


01:02:09.782 --> 01:02:12.651
I'm just a sparrow.


01:02:17.323 --> 01:02:19.892
You really love them, don't you?


01:02:19.926 --> 01:02:21.393
Your storks.


01:02:21.427 --> 01:02:24.163
Mm-hmm.


01:02:24.196 --> 01:02:27.867
Then I say we show them
who you really are.


01:02:27.900 --> 01:02:31.871
But... what if they don't want me?


01:02:31.904 --> 01:02:35.708
There's only one way to find out.


01:02:35.742 --> 01:02:38.477
Are... are you sure?


01:02:38.510 --> 01:02:40.880
- Mm-hmm.
- Otherwise, I'll adopt!


01:02:40.913 --> 01:02:43.415
Oh!


01:02:45.885 --> 01:02:48.020
I just did a Gloria half-Gainer!


01:02:48.054 --> 01:02:49.889
Come on, bird of paradise.


01:02:49.922 --> 01:02:52.224
Let's find a place to sleep it off.


01:02:52.258 --> 01:02:53.359
All right.


01:02:53.392 --> 01:02:56.028
Hey, maybe there's a disco on this tub!


01:03:07.774 --> 01:03:09.776
Hmm.


01:03:13.212 --> 01:03:16.749
Storks! Prepare to land!


01:03:16.783 --> 01:03:20.052
We can rest here until the heat passes.


01:03:21.788 --> 01:03:24.891
Ahh, what a lovely death gulley!


01:03:24.924 --> 01:03:27.894
But... there was water here last year!


01:03:27.927 --> 01:03:29.461
I'm never wrong about these things!


01:03:29.495 --> 01:03:31.397
The riverbed dried up.


01:03:31.430 --> 01:03:35.902
Humans built another one
of their stupid dams.


01:03:36.969 --> 01:03:39.772
I know some other water
holes around here.


01:03:39.806 --> 01:03:41.908
I could show you, if you like.


01:03:41.941 --> 01:03:46.045
Thank you, sir, but your
assistance is not required.


01:03:46.078 --> 01:03:47.279
Hmm.


01:03:47.313 --> 01:03:50.817
Yeah? Fine. Storks!


01:03:50.850 --> 01:03:54.053
I'll go find water. Do not wander off.


01:03:54.086 --> 01:03:57.156
You could've accepted his help.
He seemed nice.


01:03:57.189 --> 01:03:59.959
Our flock can take care of itself.


01:03:59.992 --> 01:04:01.460
I know what I'm doing.


01:04:01.493 --> 01:04:05.097
Yeah... I can see that.


01:04:05.131 --> 01:04:07.566
You will not speak to me
in this way, Max!


01:04:07.599 --> 01:04:09.001
Stop it, will you?


01:04:09.035 --> 01:04:11.938
I'm only being reasonable,


01:04:11.971 --> 01:04:14.941
and doing what is best for all of us.


01:04:14.974 --> 01:04:16.508
All of us? Really?


01:04:16.542 --> 01:04:18.978
Even my little brother?!


01:04:19.011 --> 01:04:20.847
- You just don't get it!
- Max!


01:04:20.880 --> 01:04:23.582
Stay with the flock!


01:04:23.615 --> 01:04:26.352
Go after him!


01:04:26.385 --> 01:04:28.787
Max!


01:04:33.525 --> 01:04:35.995
Big mean dummy.


01:04:36.028 --> 01:04:38.264
Jerk.


01:04:38.297 --> 01:04:40.032
It's a dangerous place!


01:04:40.066 --> 01:04:41.834
I hate you!


01:04:43.369 --> 01:04:45.504
Oh? Oh!


01:04:51.510 --> 01:04:54.046
He-hello?


01:04:54.080 --> 01:04:55.314
Who's there...


01:04:59.018 --> 01:05:01.854
Max? My boy?


01:05:07.894 --> 01:05:10.229
I can't believe we're in Tangier!


01:05:11.998 --> 01:05:14.133
Africa!


01:05:15.935 --> 01:05:17.536
Hot stuff! Ooh, baby!


01:05:17.569 --> 01:05:19.571
Which way to the Great Lake, Olga?


01:05:19.605 --> 01:05:21.908
Hm... let's see.


01:05:21.941 --> 01:05:22.875
Richard!


01:05:22.909 --> 01:05:25.244
You're that sparrow
who thinks he's a stork!


01:05:25.277 --> 01:05:27.246
We have some good news for you.


01:05:27.279 --> 01:05:29.548
- Your flock is nearby!
- Oh!


01:05:29.581 --> 01:05:31.517
Just in!


01:05:31.550 --> 01:05:33.385
They're, like, totally in trouble!


01:05:33.419 --> 01:05:36.055
A-something about
the Flock Leader's son...


01:05:36.088 --> 01:05:37.556
"Wax"?


01:05:37.589 --> 01:05:38.925
Max!


01:05:38.958 --> 01:05:39.825
That's the one!


01:05:39.858 --> 01:05:42.561
He vanished without a trace.


01:05:42.594 --> 01:05:44.663
- By the oasis.
- Oasis?


01:05:44.696 --> 01:05:46.165
I need to get there now!


01:05:46.198 --> 01:05:48.567
Er, maybe we could take him, darling.


01:05:48.600 --> 01:05:52.238
- It's not that far.
- What?! Get offline?!


01:05:52.271 --> 01:05:54.106
Did you catch a virus?


01:05:54.140 --> 01:05:55.942
Come on! Hurry! Please!


01:05:55.975 --> 01:05:58.377
We got to help him, snookums!


01:06:00.947 --> 01:06:03.282
Hey! This is better than I remembered!


01:06:03.315 --> 01:06:05.117
Come, my lovebird!


01:06:05.151 --> 01:06:08.020
Never! I'll miss a personality quiz!


01:06:08.054 --> 01:06:09.621
- Whoa!
- Trust me.


01:06:09.655 --> 01:06:11.290
You don't want to miss this.


01:06:15.627 --> 01:06:19.131
Everything's so... real!


01:06:19.165 --> 01:06:21.300
- Hurry! To the oasis!
- Love!


01:06:21.333 --> 01:06:26.072
Oh, well! There goes my vacation.


01:06:26.105 --> 01:06:28.074
Oh, I wish I'd brought my sunglasses!


01:06:31.677 --> 01:06:34.080
Max!


01:06:34.113 --> 01:06:38.084
Max!


01:06:38.117 --> 01:06:42.021
It's impossible!


01:06:42.054 --> 01:06:43.956
If only that boy had listened to me...


01:06:43.990 --> 01:06:46.258
- What are we going to do?
- I don't know what else...


01:06:46.292 --> 01:06:48.194
Where is Max?!


01:06:51.430 --> 01:06:53.732
Richard?


01:06:53.765 --> 01:06:56.102
How... how can that be?


01:06:56.135 --> 01:06:59.105
Mom! What happened to Max?


01:06:59.138 --> 01:07:00.172
He ran away.


01:07:00.206 --> 01:07:02.041
And... and we found his footsteps,


01:07:02.074 --> 01:07:03.642
leading into this tunnel.


01:07:03.675 --> 01:07:06.412
I tried everything,
but I couldn't get in.


01:07:06.445 --> 01:07:09.315
Not good... Not good at all.


01:07:09.348 --> 01:07:13.285
This is the entrance to the honey
badger's underground lair.


01:07:13.319 --> 01:07:16.188
Honey badger doesn't
sound so bad, right?


01:07:16.222 --> 01:07:18.024
Yeah! I'm gonna get Max out of there.


01:07:18.057 --> 01:07:19.191
Oh, no!


01:07:19.225 --> 01:07:22.294
The honey badger's the most
fearless predator of all.


01:07:22.328 --> 01:07:25.597
Instant death is pretty much a given.


01:07:25.631 --> 01:07:29.135
- Uh-huh? How would you know?
- Basic cable.


01:07:29.168 --> 01:07:31.203
- Ah.
- Okay, I'm going in.


01:07:31.237 --> 01:07:33.339
No! It's too dangerous for you...


01:07:33.372 --> 01:07:35.007
We have no other choice!


01:07:35.041 --> 01:07:37.543
You storks don't fit
through that entrance.


01:07:37.576 --> 01:07:39.145
We're coming with you!


01:07:39.178 --> 01:07:42.514
We'll show this badger
some honey, right, Kiki?


01:07:42.548 --> 01:07:44.216
Right, Kiki?!


01:07:44.250 --> 01:07:48.187
Remind me again why I'm signing
up for this kamikaze mission?


01:07:49.421 --> 01:07:52.058
Because you tricked us and you feel bad.


01:07:52.091 --> 01:07:54.726
Oh. Yeah. Count me in.


01:07:56.228 --> 01:07:58.164
- Richard!
- What?!


01:07:58.197 --> 01:08:03.802
Be careful. Please.


01:08:03.835 --> 01:08:05.171
Hmm.


01:08:10.742 --> 01:08:13.179
I'll guard the entrance!


01:08:22.088 --> 01:08:24.156
Oh, this was a bad idea.


01:08:26.758 --> 01:08:28.260
And I know bad ideas.


01:08:28.294 --> 01:08:30.262
"Bad idea" is my middle name!


01:08:30.296 --> 01:08:32.531
Shh!


01:08:33.799 --> 01:08:36.168
I'm a disco-lover, not a badger-fighter!


01:08:36.202 --> 01:08:38.270
Oh!


01:08:39.605 --> 01:08:41.140
He must be this way.


01:08:41.173 --> 01:08:44.776
Good. So let's go...


01:08:44.810 --> 01:08:46.078
that way.


01:08:46.112 --> 01:08:47.213
Okay, okay!


01:08:50.416 --> 01:08:53.085
That's slightly creepy.


01:08:53.119 --> 01:08:57.123
Is that... Max?


01:08:57.156 --> 01:09:00.126
That look like bird bones to you?


01:09:00.159 --> 01:09:03.362
How should I know? I'm vegan.


01:09:03.395 --> 01:09:06.398
And I'm a meat-eater. Remember that.


01:09:11.403 --> 01:09:14.273
So, ah, you guys give any more thought


01:09:14.306 --> 01:09:16.542
to my "running away" idea?


01:09:16.575 --> 01:09:19.811
Everyone, take a tunnel.
But be silent, okay?


01:09:21.247 --> 01:09:23.081
That means you, Showtune.


01:09:24.416 --> 01:09:26.418
- Hey!
- Shh!


01:09:26.452 --> 01:09:27.619
Take your tunnel!


01:09:27.653 --> 01:09:30.322
Can't we at least flip a coin?


01:09:30.356 --> 01:09:31.557
Shake a tailfeather!


01:09:33.159 --> 01:09:36.362
Well, at least I'll leave
a gorgeous corpse.


01:09:40.266 --> 01:09:42.168
Max?


01:09:45.304 --> 01:09:46.304
Max?


01:09:59.885 --> 01:10:01.287
Hmm.


01:10:04.356 --> 01:10:05.657
Mmm, hearty crunch.


01:10:05.691 --> 01:10:08.660
With a delightfully gooey center.


01:10:08.694 --> 01:10:10.696
Max?


01:10:10.729 --> 01:10:12.431
Whoa!


01:10:26.678 --> 01:10:28.780
Max!


01:10:28.814 --> 01:10:30.516
Is he okay?


01:10:30.549 --> 01:10:32.318
Phew!


01:10:33.985 --> 01:10:37.489
- Get up, Max!
- Oh.


01:10:37.523 --> 01:10:41.293
Oh? Little brother?


01:10:41.327 --> 01:10:44.330
Oh! How did you... get here?


01:10:44.363 --> 01:10:48.234
Shh! We've gotta get you out of here.


01:10:48.267 --> 01:10:49.335
Where's Kiki?


01:10:49.368 --> 01:10:52.371
Oh, great.


01:10:52.404 --> 01:10:55.574
My dry-cleaning bill is
going to be astronomical!


01:11:01.447 --> 01:11:03.315
I'm seeing double. Triple. Quadruple!


01:11:07.018 --> 01:11:11.390
Running away! Running away!


01:11:15.261 --> 01:11:17.296
- It's him!
- Ooops! Sorry.


01:11:17.329 --> 01:11:18.297
Great.


01:11:18.330 --> 01:11:19.598
This way out!


01:11:21.433 --> 01:11:23.302
Which tunnel?


01:11:25.271 --> 01:11:26.305
This one looks good!


01:11:28.740 --> 01:11:30.376
Kiki!


01:11:33.412 --> 01:11:35.881
I'm too colorful to die!


01:11:44.890 --> 01:11:46.592
Oh!


01:11:49.828 --> 01:11:52.464
♪ Monsieur Honey Badger! ♪


01:11:52.498 --> 01:11:53.498
Huh?


01:11:54.733 --> 01:11:57.369
♪ There's a new me coming out ♪


01:11:57.403 --> 01:11:59.438
♪ And I just had to live ♪


01:11:59.471 --> 01:12:01.307
♪ And I wanna give ♪


01:12:01.340 --> 01:12:03.442
♪ I'm completely positive ♪


01:12:03.475 --> 01:12:05.411
♪ I think this time around ♪


01:12:05.444 --> 01:12:07.413
♪ I am gonna do it ♪


01:12:07.446 --> 01:12:09.781
♪ Like you never knew it ♪


01:12:09.815 --> 01:12:12.284
♪ Ooh, I'll make it through ♪


01:12:12.318 --> 01:12:13.438
♪ The time has come for me ♪


01:12:13.452 --> 01:12:15.387
♪ To break out of this shell ♪


01:12:15.421 --> 01:12:17.789
♪ I have to shout ♪


01:12:17.823 --> 01:12:19.391
♪ I am coming out ♪


01:12:19.425 --> 01:12:20.959
Huh?


01:12:25.764 --> 01:12:28.334
Olga, Kiki! Get Max out of here!


01:12:28.367 --> 01:12:29.568
But what about you?


01:12:29.601 --> 01:12:30.869
Just do it!


01:12:36.007 --> 01:12:38.076
- Just my luck.
- A dead end?


01:12:38.109 --> 01:12:40.746
Everybody, keep looking!


01:12:40.779 --> 01:12:43.482
There must be another way to get in!


01:12:43.515 --> 01:12:45.617
- Huh?
- Dad! Mom!


01:12:45.651 --> 01:12:47.453
- We're here!
- Max!


01:12:47.486 --> 01:12:49.054
Dig here!


01:12:52.991 --> 01:12:55.594
Ahh! Beaks!


01:12:55.627 --> 01:12:58.964
- Ah!
- Ouch!


01:13:00.499 --> 01:13:02.701
Son! Oh!


01:13:02.734 --> 01:13:04.503
I'm so sorry.


01:13:04.536 --> 01:13:06.004
Dad! Richard's still in there.


01:13:06.037 --> 01:13:07.105
No!


01:13:19.150 --> 01:13:20.486
Ah!


01:13:21.887 --> 01:13:23.389
Richard! Get out of there!


01:13:30.396 --> 01:13:32.798
Don't you touch him, you beast!


01:13:39.070 --> 01:13:42.441
- It's collapsing!
- That cave wasn't up to code!


01:13:46.011 --> 01:13:47.413
Oh!


01:13:47.446 --> 01:13:50.382
Here, honey bunny!


01:13:50.416 --> 01:13:52.918
Looking for a tasty sparrow?


01:14:05.431 --> 01:14:07.399
Oh!


01:14:31.056 --> 01:14:32.724
Richard!


01:14:32.758 --> 01:14:34.760
Where... where is he?


01:14:36.227 --> 01:14:37.929
- Richard?
- Come on out!


01:14:40.466 --> 01:14:43.469
Can you see him, Oleg?


01:14:43.502 --> 01:14:45.704
Oh, no.


01:14:59.084 --> 01:15:01.820
Huh?


01:15:04.022 --> 01:15:06.124
Do you see what I see?


01:15:06.157 --> 01:15:07.993
What?


01:15:11.963 --> 01:15:13.532
Richard!


01:15:13.565 --> 01:15:15.767
- Oh!
- It's Richard!


01:15:15.801 --> 01:15:16.935
Yeah! Ha ha!


01:15:16.968 --> 01:15:18.169
What?


01:15:23.141 --> 01:15:25.243
Just in time, little brother.


01:15:25.276 --> 01:15:29.548
Oh, you sure know
how to make an entrance.


01:15:30.982 --> 01:15:33.819
Oh... I'll never let you go again!


01:15:36.522 --> 01:15:38.123
How did you ever get here?


01:15:38.156 --> 01:15:41.092
Everybody, these are my friends,


01:15:41.126 --> 01:15:43.028
- Olga and Kiki...
- Ahem.


01:15:43.061 --> 01:15:45.631
And Oleg.


01:15:45.664 --> 01:15:47.131
I wouldn't be here
if it wasn't for them.


01:15:47.132 --> 01:15:49.535
Enchanté!


01:15:49.568 --> 01:15:52.270
It was our pleasure, right, Oleg?


01:15:56.542 --> 01:15:59.577
I owe you an apology, Richard.


01:16:01.312 --> 01:16:04.015
I should have believed in you.


01:16:04.049 --> 01:16:08.486
Sparrow or stork... you are my son.


01:16:15.260 --> 01:16:18.630
I... I can be part of the family?


01:16:18.664 --> 01:16:21.299
Nothing would make me prouder.


01:16:27.673 --> 01:16:29.040
Mmm.


01:16:29.074 --> 01:16:30.909
Aww!


01:16:33.278 --> 01:16:36.081
Next stop, the Great Lake!


01:16:36.114 --> 01:16:38.316
Richard...


01:16:38.349 --> 01:16:40.552
would you lead us?


01:16:40.586 --> 01:16:42.688
Really?! Me?


01:16:42.721 --> 01:16:46.825
When you're ready, give the signal.


01:16:46.858 --> 01:16:48.727
Hey, Richard?


01:16:48.760 --> 01:16:51.697
South is that way!


01:16:57.636 --> 01:17:00.839
Follow me!


01:17:00.872 --> 01:17:02.608
Wait for us!


01:17:02.641 --> 01:17:05.010
We're not all storks, you know!


01:17:05.043 --> 01:17:07.345
Come on, everyone! Keep the pace!


01:17:07.378 --> 01:17:10.716
Jeez, little brother!
Been training?


01:17:13.685 --> 01:17:16.121
Ah...


01:17:26.231 --> 01:17:28.600
Whoa! That must be it!


01:17:28.634 --> 01:17:32.738
Yeah! The Great Lake!


01:17:35.941 --> 01:17:39.878
Ooh! Now that's what I call
a deluxe resort!


01:17:39.911 --> 01:17:42.948
Thanks, Oleg.


01:17:42.981 --> 01:17:45.250
I couldn't have done it without you.


01:17:46.818 --> 01:17:49.888
We did it. We really did it!


01:17:49.921 --> 01:17:53.258
Woo-hoo!


01:17:53.291 --> 01:17:58.163
Come on, guys! Yeah!

